WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.940
If you take blood pressure or other heart medications, this one is important.

2
00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:10.120
In most cases, blood pressure medications should be taken the morning of your procedure, even with just a small sip of water.

3
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:17.220
However, please confirm this with your doctor's office in advance, as recommendations can vary depending on your specific medication.

4
00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:21.080
Do not skip your blood pressure medication without checking with us first.

5
00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:28.400
Keeping your blood pressure stable during the procedure is important for your safety, and your doctor wants to make sure you're set up well before you arrive.
